# Bot2 casts Mox Ruby, Mox Sapphire, then Brain Freeze, whose storm puts two copies on the stack (CR 702.40a), all
# aimed at Bot1. Bot1 passes once so that the storm trigger resolves and the copies exist, then flashes in Aven Interrupter and exiles the topmost copy. A copy that leaves the stack ceases to
# exist (CR 111.7, 707.10a): it is not in exile and is not plotted. The Brain Freeze and the other copy resolve, so
# Bot1 mills six cards (9 in the library, 3 left) and no Brain Freeze is in exile.

